        "raw_sha256": "1fd1b49127ae55c4a6c84466dc802e22ed7ef9cac01c987a1ab2393d09e16322",
        "mathtext": "The construction is now complete. The following algorithm gives its\npathwise prescription: it draws the reference point and momentum, evolves\nthe process with generator (3.5) for time $\\pi$ , and\nreturns only the final position.\n",
        "disposition": "NODE",
        "classification": "selected-source-node",
        "reason": "Algorithm linkage; no whole algorithm correctness claim.",
