      {
        "id": "alg1",
        "tag": "figure",
        "class": "ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top",
        "start_line": 1559,
        "end_line": 1638,
        "raw_sha256": "00fa63f86419cb2c484ca2edd8c62aa4fa582ae9957e0b64a2509ac94e3d8463",
        "mathtext": "Algorithm 1 Simulation of the ideal conditional half-turn process\n\n1:\n\nInput: state $(x,y)$\n\n2:\n\nDraw $\\widetilde{X}\\sim\\pi_{\\eta}^{X\\mid Y=y}$ and\n$p_{0}\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I)$ independently.\n\n3:\n\nQuery $\\nabla V(\\widetilde{X})$ .\n\n4:\n\nSet $x_{0}\\leftarrow x$ .\n\n5:\n\nEvolve $(x_{t},p_{t})$ according to\n\n$\\dot{x}=\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,p\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\dot{p}=-\\frac{x-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}-\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\nabla V(\\widetilde{X})\\,,$\n\n(3.8)\n\nuntil $t=\\pi$ .\n\n6:\n\nDuring the evolution, generate bounce events at rate\n\n$\\lambda_{\\widetilde{X}}(x,p)=\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\bigl[p^{\\top}[\\nabla V(x)-\\nabla V(\\widetilde{X})]\\bigr]_{+}\\,.$\n\n(3.9)\n\n7:\n\nAt each bounce, set\n$p_{t}\\leftarrow R_{\\nabla V(x_{t})-\\nabla V(\\widetilde{X})}p_{t}$ .\n\n8:\n\nreturn $x_{\\pi}$\n",
        "disposition": "NODE",
        "classification": "selected-source-node",
        "reason": "Finite mechanics use lines 1,3–7 at fixed reference; line 2 sampling and line 8 returned law remain OPEN.",
        "overlap_policy": "Nested paragraph/theorem/display records overlap intentionally; coverage is by source region, not a theorem-count metric.",
        "compiled76_projection": {
          "status": "partially-selected-finite-mechanics",
          "current_BODY_or_definition_lines": [
