        "mathtext": "The following proposition quantifies the stationary bounce count of the\nideal half-turn process.\n",
        "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
        "classification": "excluded-with-reason",
        "reason": "Stationary bounce count/expected cost is outside this finite-recursion delta and remains OPEN.",
