        "mathtext": "$\\mathsf{R}(x,p)\\coloneqq(x,-p)\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt(\\mathsf{R}F)(x,p)\\coloneqq F(\\mathsf{R}(x,p))\\,.$\n",
