      {
        "id": "A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p3",
        "tag": "div",
        "class": "ltx_para",
        "start_line": 3105,
        "end_line": 3146,
        "raw_sha256": "2bb2cd029fa6c61855db89fb65cd66182b1122d5d32662d3b7315e4c92f28e19",
        "mathtext": "Along\n$\\zeta_{s}=(x_{s},p_{s})=\\Phi_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{0})$ ,\n\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}s}\\log\\nu_{\\eta,y}(\\zeta_{s})=-\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,p_{s}^{\\top}h_{\\widetilde{x}}(x_{s})=-\\bigl\\{\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{s})-\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\mathsf{R}\\zeta_{s})\\bigr\\}\\,.$\n\n(A.4)\n\nMoreover, by definition of $\\mathsf{R}$ and $\\Phi_{t}$ ,\n\n$\\mathsf{R}\\Phi_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}\\mathsf{R}=\\Phi_{-t}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathsf{R}\\mathsf{S}_{\\widetilde{x}}=\\mathsf{S}_{\\widetilde{x}}\\mathsf{R}\\,.$\n\nIf $\\zeta^{+}=\\mathsf{S}_{\\widetilde{x}}\\zeta^{-}$ is a non-trivial jump, then\n$h_{\\widetilde{x}}(x)\\neq 0$ ,\n$(p^{-})^{\\top}h_{\\widetilde{x}}(x)>0$ , and\n\n$\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta^{-})=\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\mathsf{R}\\zeta^{+})\\,.$\n\n(A.5)\n\nThe flow and $\\mathsf{R}$ preserve Lebesgue measure, as does the possibly\ndiscontinuous bounce map: by Fubini’s theorem and orthogonality, for\nevery integrable $F$ ,\n\n$\\int F(\\mathsf{S}_{\\widetilde{x}}(x,p))\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}p=\\int F(x,p)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}p\\,.$\n\n(A.6)\n",
        "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
        "classification": "excluded-with-reason",
        "reason": "Later A.1 stationarity/reversal/trajectory-law/semigroup argument, outside the selected finite-recursion delta; retained RAW, no admission.",
        "overlap_policy": "Nested paragraph/theorem/display records overlap intentionally; coverage is by source region, not a theorem-count metric.",
