        "mathtext": "$(\\zeta_{s})_{0\\leq s\\leq t}\\longmapsto(\\mathsf{R}\\zeta_{t-s})_{0\\leq s\\leq t}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt(t_{1},\\ldots,t_{n})\\longmapsto(t-t_{n},\\ldots,t-t_{1})\\,.$\n\n(A.8)\n",
