        "raw_sha256": "730a2fe2abca13d231fab52d7577d7e7de9e0aa5b62efc70ba6d311281e2cb70",
        "mathtext": "$\\nu_{\\eta,y}(\\zeta_{0})\\,e^{-\\int_{0}^{t}\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{s})\\,\\mathrm{d}s}=\\nu_{\\eta,y}(\\zeta_{t})\\,e^{-\\int_{0}^{t}\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\mathsf{R}\\zeta_{s})\\,\\mathrm{d}s}\\,.$\n",
